# Stow ignore patterns for the cards package.
#
# Files matched here are kept in the package as in-repo documentation but
# NOT symlinked into $HOME by `stow -t ~ cards`.

# Top-level CLAUDE.md — twitter already owns ~/CLAUDE.md (claim-on-first-package).
# Cards documentation lives in-package; Claude auto-discovers it via tree-walk
# from any cwd under ~/dotfiles/cards/.
^/CLAUDE\.md$

# Design specs and brainstorming artifacts live in-package only; never
# symlink into $HOME. Discoverable via /docs/superpowers/specs/ in the repo.
^/docs/
